/Positioned><Positioned left="832" top="955" width="262" height="25"><Container width="262" height="25" alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#EFE6D3" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC">4 · 4</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1096" top="955" width="32" height="25"><Container width="32" height="25" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">段</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="512" top="980" width="320" height="25"><Container width="320" height="25" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#B9C4D8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">低于下限 0.557</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="832" top="980" width="262" height="25"><Container width="262" height="25" alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#EFE6D3" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC">0 · 0</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1096" top="980" width="32" height="25"><Container width="32" height="25" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">段</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="512" top="1005" width="320" height="25"><Container width="320" height="25" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#B9C4D8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">单段最大（掠入端）</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="832" top="1005" width="262" height="25"><Container width="262" height="25" alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#E1552B" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC">8.50 / 6.81</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="1096" top="1005" width="32" height="25"><Container width="32" height="25" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">km/s</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="1088" width="1056" height="1"><Container width="1056" height="1" color="#22304F"/></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="1100" width="1056" height="18"><Container width="1056" height="18" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">来源：NASA 两条日食路径页中央线表（SE2024Apr08Tpath 98 行、SE2027Aug02Tpath 102 行，2 分钟间隔的经纬度、带宽与中心食时长）。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="1119" width="1056" height="18"><Container width="1056" height="18" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">常数：月球平均轨道速度 1.022 km/s（nasa-moon-fact.html）；赤道半径 6378.137 km、恒星日 23.9345 h（nasa-earth-fact.html）算出地表 0.465 km/s。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="1138" width="1056" height="18"><Container width="1056" height="18" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">推算：沿轨距离、影速、宽度÷时长、脚印长宽比与合成带全部由 derive_speed.py 实算，NASA 页面本身不给影速。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="72" top="1157" width="1056" height="18"><Container width="1056" height="18" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7E8CA6" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">限制：2 分钟采样只能给段平均，首末段接近掠入畸变最强（单段最大 8.50 km/s）；长宽比是几何解释，不是严格的球面矢量反解。</Text></Container></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>